round: #fff229;\n      padding: 0 1px;\n    }\n    .stamp {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 51px;\n      top: 98px;\n      width: 80px;\n      height: 47px;\n      border: 5px solid #ed4d47;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      transform: rotate(-12deg);\n      color: #28bcd9;\n      font-size: 23px;\n      line-height: 36px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .section.drive {\n      margin-top: 25px;\n    }\n    .wrapline {\n      white-space: normal;\n      padding-left: 0;\n      text-indent: 0;\n    }\n    .continued {\n      padding-left: 0;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>一天考过科目一最全知识点!</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">三、酒驾相关</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">1.公安机关交通管理部门<span class=\"mark\">约束至酒醒</span>。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">2.<span class=\"mark\">处200-2000</span>元罚款，吊销驾驶证。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">3.<span class=\"mark\">五年内不得</span>重新取得机动车驾驶证。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">4.血液含酒精量：</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">a)<span class=\"mark\">20-80mg</span>/ml，酒驾；　 b)<span class=\"mark\">80-100mg</span>/ml，醉驾。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"stamp\">超全</div>\n\n    <section class=\"section drive\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">四、行驶</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">1.通过路口<span class=\"yellow\">交替使用远近光灯</span>。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">2.不靠山体的车比较危险，<span class=\"yellow\">会车时先走</span>。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">3.高速路会车时，<span class=\"yellow\">150米外</span>，改为近光灯。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">4.<span class=\"yellow\">站3D5</span>:在站点(公交车站，消防站等)30米内，路口、窄路等50米</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">内不得停车。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">5.实习期间，应让<span class=\"yellow\">3年以上驾龄</span>陪驾。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">6.在路口，靠路口中心点位置应该<span class=\"yellow\">在左侧转弯</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">7.<span class=\"yellow\">右方道路来车先行</span>，然后看谁的右方没车就谁先行。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">8.<span class=\"yellow\">转弯车辆让直行车辆</span>先行。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">9.准备进入环形路口的<span class=\"yellow\">让已在路口内的车</span>先行。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">10.右转弯车让左转弯车辆先行如遇特殊车辆执行任务，不受规则</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">限制，应<span class=\"yellow\">直接让行</span>。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">11.当路口没有交通信号灯时，<span class=\"yellow\">减速慢行</span>。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">12.路口是绿灯车辆的地面，只能<span class=\"yellow\">继续向前行驶</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">13.驾驶机动车在道路上追逐竞驶，情节恶劣<span class=\"yellow\">处拘役，并处罚金</span>。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">14.撞人问题:是否逃逸，逃逸与死亡时间前后</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">a)撞人没逃逸，<span class=\"yellow\">3年以下</span>;</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">b)撞人逃跑或撞伤逃跑后，未致人死亡，<span class=\"yellow\">3~7年</span>;</div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
